    "Tap a thing to use it. H: hack vision. B: the board, to wire things up."
  ],
  "introTouch": [
    "Capsule 7B. Home: four walls, one window, rent \"pending\".",
    "Door's locked, the router's dark, and Pixel is asleep on the bed, as is tradition.",
